WEBVTT

00:00:15.830 --> 00:00:18.660
Honestly, I thought that would be harder...

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:24.670
I guess the legendary murderer was 
weakened by his years of confinement.

00:00:25.090 --> 00:00:27.410
We had this ready, just in case.

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:29.130
But we didn't even need it.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:30.920
Be sure to hide that when we get to the toll booth.

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:33.230
I know.

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:38.400
Anyway, do you think the shrine left that girl there

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.130
because of the discord between 
the Kuga and Hyuga families?

00:00:42.130 --> 00:00:43.480
Don't even talk about that.

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:47.290
We're at the bottom of the totem pole.

00:00:47.290 --> 00:00:49.310
We shouldn't get involved in anything that...

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:11.470
Damn it!

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:29.560
The Kuga... The Hyuga...

00:01:30.310 --> 00:01:34.500
The shrine, the village... None of it matters.

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:38.210
Right...

00:01:39.560 --> 00:01:40.920
Kyohei?

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:33.630
Utao-chan, you don't need to do that so hard.

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:34.760
Take it easy.

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:35.770
Okay!

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:42.550
<i>I'm glad she's helping,</i>

00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:45.570
<i>but this will be a long day...</i>

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:02.680
I'm back!

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:06.650
Hi, there! Nice to see you!

00:04:07.220 --> 00:04:09.410
Wh-What's wrong, Utao-chan?

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:11.960
Yo.

00:04:11.960 --> 00:04:14.680
You're Uta-bo, Hibino's relative?

00:04:14.680 --> 00:04:15.880
Who's this?

00:04:15.880 --> 00:04:18.090
A school friend, Suou-chan.

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:19.830
Nice to meet you!

00:04:19.830 --> 00:04:22.340
So cute! So little!

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:24.050
You're trying really hard, aren't you?

00:04:24.050 --> 00:04:26.270
Wh-What's wrong with her?

00:04:26.270 --> 00:04:27.390
Don't worry about it.

00:04:27.390 --> 00:04:29.390
That's just how she is.

00:04:29.410 --> 00:04:31.010
I am worried!

00:04:31.010 --> 00:04:32.370
Come on... It's fine.

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:33.880
Right, Uta-bo?

00:04:35.740 --> 00:04:38.790
I'm helping out! Don't bother me!

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:41.840
<b>Episode 3</b>

00:04:38.820 --> 00:04:41.840
<b>It Attacks...</b>

00:04:42.190 --> 00:04:44.340
H-Here you are.

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:46.640
Here you are.

00:04:58.410 --> 00:05:00.860
I'm the only one you're being mean to, right?

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:02.300
That isn't true.

00:05:02.300 --> 00:05:03.400
Utao-chan!

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:05.560
I'll take care of the rest.

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:06.820
You can go.

00:05:07.110 --> 00:05:08.360
Okay!

00:05:09.210 --> 00:05:10.560
Wait! Wait! Wait!

00:05:10.560 --> 00:05:13.480
You don't need to be in such a hurry.

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.880
I have to study.

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:23.130
<i>I want to beat Mach Dogfight with Kukuri...</i>

00:05:23.910 --> 00:05:26.560
You can study later!

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:28.390
I've come all this way to see you.

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:30.010
I'm not something for you to stare at.

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:32.680
Oh, come on... Hang out a bit!

00:05:33.730 --> 00:05:36.370
I'll let you eat all the cake you want!

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:38.510
Here you go.

00:05:38.510 --> 00:05:39.980
Special gâteaux chocolat.

00:05:42.640 --> 00:05:43.450
Eat up! Eat up!

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:45.440
Thanks!

00:05:53.550 --> 00:05:55.440
So good!

00:05:58.040 --> 00:06:00.000
She looks happy.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.790
It's nice being a kid.

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:03.420
Why?

00:06:03.420 --> 00:06:05.130
If I let down my guard,

00:06:05.130 --> 00:06:08.630
I start fattening up right here.

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:16.350
Next thing you know, you're beyond saving.

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:18.010
At least, sometimes.

00:06:19.170 --> 00:06:20.670
Now that you mention it...

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:22.750
Utao-chan, maybe you have gained some weight.

00:06:28.270 --> 00:06:30.350
<i>These are cakes for our new menu.</i>

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:32.890
<i>Could you sample them and give me your opinion?</i>

00:06:32.890 --> 00:06:34.030
<i>Sure, sure, sure!</i>

00:06:37.220 --> 00:06:39.670
<i>Utao-chan, what do you want for lunch?</i>

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:40.760
<i>Cake!</i>

00:06:46.820 --> 00:06:50.220
I think Uta-bo knows what we're talking about.

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:52.610
She's still growing, so it's okay, right?

00:06:53.870 --> 00:06:54.970
I don't know...

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:57.270
If you eat whatever you want, 
thinking kids can't get fat,

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:59.590
it's a one-way ticket to fatso land.

00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:01.020
Well?

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:02.750
Want another plate?

00:07:02.750 --> 00:07:05.320
Don't worry about it...

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:07.230
Thank you for the meal!

00:07:09.410 --> 00:07:10.950
Oh, Suou-chan...

00:07:11.280 --> 00:07:15.130
Utao-chan, could you sample 
some more cake for me?

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:16.670
Dad!

00:07:16.670 --> 00:07:17.710
I'm back!

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:20.910
Utao, I bought that cake you wanted.

00:07:21.900 --> 00:07:22.810
What?

00:07:22.810 --> 00:07:24.370
What's going on?

00:07:27.240 --> 00:07:30.440
You never know what will happen...

00:07:30.440 --> 00:07:31.970
I didn't expect

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:35.140
to find you freeloading at Hibino's place.

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:37.250
Um...

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:39.480
If you don't need anything, I'll be on my way...

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:41.560
You're no fun at all!

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:43.040
Sit down!

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:45.410
What's wrong with you?

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:47.390
What I'm trying to say is this...

00:07:47.390 --> 00:07:49.200
I'm sure the accident was hard,

00:07:49.200 --> 00:07:51.980
but it all worked out in the end, right?

00:07:53.360 --> 00:07:55.780
It all worked out, huh?

00:07:56.380 --> 00:08:01.310
You couldn't have asked for a better chance.

00:08:05.530 --> 00:08:06.290
What?

00:08:09.590 --> 00:08:15.460
Hey, Kuga-kun... All the guys in the seminar hate you now.

00:08:15.460 --> 00:08:17.460
<i>Give me a break.</i>

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:21.640
But you have a cute sister with you all the time.

00:08:22.190 --> 00:08:24.270
So I guess you can't do much of anything.

00:08:24.610 --> 00:08:25.610
Right?

00:08:27.460 --> 00:08:29.860
Oh, you three seem to be having fun.

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:37.510
Oh, right. Utao-chan!

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:41.090
Tomorrow, I don't have class.

00:08:41.090 --> 00:08:43.140
So do you want to come along with me?

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:44.970
Really? Can I?

00:08:44.970 --> 00:08:48.420
Kuga-kun hasn't taken you anywhere, has he?

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:50.460
But I need to train...

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:54.800
Then bring Kukuri, okay?

00:08:55.910 --> 00:08:57.930
It's fine. Right, Dad?

00:08:57.930 --> 00:08:58.600
What?

00:08:58.980 --> 00:09:01.420
But... Without Utao-chan,

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:03.100
the café's sales will, well...

00:09:03.100 --> 00:09:03.790
It'll be fine!

00:09:05.990 --> 00:09:07.400
I'll go!

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:17.340
We need a wide-open space 
for Kukuri's training...

00:09:17.690 --> 00:09:20.800
Somewhere no one will see it.

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:23.840
I see...

00:09:26.900 --> 00:09:28.860
Come to think of it,

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:31.180
I don't know what's inside Kukuri.

00:09:31.180 --> 00:09:33.390
Will it be okay in the ocean?

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:38.260
You hadn't considered it?

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:41.730
Normal water's fine, but...

00:09:41.730 --> 00:09:44.270
Th-Then it should be okay, right?

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:51.900
There's lots of stuff down there.

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:55.300
So you can see through Kukuri's eyes, huh?

00:09:55.300 --> 00:10:00.610
Yes. But it's blurry, and I can't see far...

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:02.670
Hey, Utao-chan.

00:10:02.670 --> 00:10:05.430
You're not practicing if you're just moving around.

00:10:05.430 --> 00:10:06.910
Why not dig something up?

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:15.050
Got it!

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:34.950
What? What?

00:10:34.950 --> 00:10:36.820
Wow! Did you see that, Mom?

00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:38.110
An explosion?!

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:43.170
That scared me...

00:10:43.170 --> 00:10:45.590
I wonder if Kyohei can come yet.

00:10:45.990 --> 00:10:49.160
He said he'd call after he 
finished at his part-time job.

00:10:49.160 --> 00:10:51.630
Maybe I'll message him.

00:10:55.310 --> 00:10:57.690
I want a cell phone, too.

00:10:57.690 --> 00:10:59.310
He won't buy you one?

00:11:00.530 --> 00:11:03.290
Well, you don't need one for safety.

00:11:03.290 --> 00:11:04.640
You have Kukuri.

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:07.330
But do you have anyone to message?

00:11:07.330 --> 00:11:08.700
Kyohei!

00:11:08.700 --> 00:11:10.990
You see him every day.

00:11:14.890 --> 00:11:16.740
I'm late!

00:11:20.670 --> 00:11:23.120
It's from Hibino-san?

00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:37.960
Yo.

00:11:56.860 --> 00:11:58.010
Thanks.

00:12:01.590 --> 00:12:06.030
Oh, yeah. When I was standing in that line,

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:09.030
someone looked really unhappy when they saw me.

00:12:09.030 --> 00:12:10.410
Of course they did.

00:12:10.950 --> 00:12:13.210
You really stink...

00:12:17.890 --> 00:12:19.740
So I got pissed.

00:12:19.740 --> 00:12:24.130
And then two or three of those 
happy-looking kids got it in the neck.

00:12:32.150 --> 00:12:34.490
Go back to the village.

00:12:37.090 --> 00:12:40.650
After all these years, 
that's what you tell your old friend?

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:45.740
You never came to see me anyway.

00:12:47.830 --> 00:12:49.090
I'm sorry!

00:12:49.900 --> 00:12:51.120
Don't do that.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:51.700
I said...

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:52.740
Don't do that!

00:12:54.530 --> 00:12:58.340
Don't cause any more problems...

00:12:58.710 --> 00:13:01.810
Would you please go home?

00:13:03.810 --> 00:13:05.470
I don't like that...

00:13:06.940 --> 00:13:11.010
You know, the way you 
bow your head like that...

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:13.400
It hurts me.

00:13:15.010 --> 00:13:16.190
I know.

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:20.210
That girl with you in the karaoke box...

00:13:20.210 --> 00:13:21.190
Your girlfriend?

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:23.610
Maybe I'll kill her.

00:13:27.550 --> 00:13:28.680
That's right!

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:29.560
Be mad.

00:13:29.560 --> 00:13:30.950
Don't pretend you're such a loser.

00:13:30.950 --> 00:13:33.150
Don't pretend it never happened!

00:13:33.150 --> 00:13:35.010
This is who you really are.

00:13:35.010 --> 00:13:36.330
Don't forget it!

00:13:36.330 --> 00:13:41.420
Ever since then, you and I 
have had the same path!

00:13:53.850 --> 00:13:55.060
You're not answering it?

00:13:59.100 --> 00:14:00.040
Yes?

00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:01.210
Hibino-san.

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:03.280
I'm sorry I'm late.

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:05.490
Yes.

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:09.030
Yeah... That's right.

00:14:09.490 --> 00:14:11.200
I understand. Then...

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:13.410
It must be hard to look so good.

00:14:14.230 --> 00:14:15.250
Go home!

00:14:21.730 --> 00:14:23.080
Jeez...

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:26.590
Aki's such a pain.

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:31.100
Right, Kyohei?

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:32.680
Koushiro?

00:14:33.740 --> 00:14:35.980
But don't worry.

00:14:36.650 --> 00:14:40.520
Hyuga's gonna take away that 
pain in the butt for you.

00:14:42.570 --> 00:14:43.290
What's this?

00:14:43.830 --> 00:14:45.980
That Aki...

00:14:45.980 --> 00:14:48.530
He's good at running if nothing else.

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:50.990
Wait, Koushiro!

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:51.990
Wait!

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:56.330
Close your eyes.

00:14:56.330 --> 00:14:58.270
Cover your ears.

00:14:58.270 --> 00:14:59.960
Don't say a word.

00:15:00.570 --> 00:15:03.540
If you plan to return to being a normal person.

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:19.170
He said to go home,

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:20.890
since he thinks he won't make it.

00:15:21.660 --> 00:15:23.900
We can't even meet up with him, after all this?

00:15:23.900 --> 00:15:25.240
Looks that way.

00:15:25.240 --> 00:15:26.530
Oh, well...

00:15:27.180 --> 00:15:29.470
Want to get dinner somewhere?

00:15:29.470 --> 00:15:31.960
Somewhere he'll be jealous about later on?

00:15:32.580 --> 00:15:34.030
Cake!

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:47.710
Utao-chan!

00:16:14.010 --> 00:16:15.620
I guess it's all right now.

00:16:20.830 --> 00:16:23.000
That's your second time rescuing someone.

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:25.690
This time, you saved me.

00:16:26.510 --> 00:16:27.500
Thank you.

00:16:27.890 --> 00:16:29.670
Your god's pretty impressive.

00:16:38.440 --> 00:16:41.020
<i>You really have improved.</i>

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:44.220
<i>I'm impressed, Utao.</i>

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:54.570
What's wrong, Utao-chan?

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:57.930
Utao-chan?

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:13.390
<i>I didn't expect to see Koushiro...</i>

00:17:13.390 --> 00:17:15.300
<i>He's a pain to fight against.</i>

00:17:16.590 --> 00:17:21.080
<i>They're all really pissing me off.</i>

00:17:21.650 --> 00:17:23.020
<i>Especially you,</i>

00:17:23.960 --> 00:17:25.580
<i>Kyohei.</i>

00:17:27.710 --> 00:17:29.730
<i>Back then,</i>

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:32.990
<i>we opened the gate to hell, 
and lost all kinds of things</i>

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:35.300
<i>that we could never recover in exchange.</i>

00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:38.930
<i>And you're going to pretend it never happened?</i>

00:17:38.930 --> 00:17:40.840
<i>To live a happy life...</i>

00:17:40.840 --> 00:17:42.540
<i>You don't deserve it.</i>

00:17:45.930 --> 00:17:48.470
<i>It's the opposite, Aki.</i>

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:53.390
<i>It's because we sacrificed 
those things we could never recover.</i>

00:17:53.450 --> 00:17:54.200
<i>Right?</i>

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:08.650
Found you.

00:18:09.430 --> 00:18:11.150
Koushiro.

00:18:13.240 --> 00:18:14.610
And there we are.

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:16.520
Thank you.

00:18:16.520 --> 00:18:20.000
I'll deposit your reward in the usual account.

00:18:20.410 --> 00:18:23.550
I think the next job will be next week.

00:18:25.910 --> 00:18:29.250
Oh, I heard something...

00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:33.720
Your father's a detective, huh?

00:18:34.170 --> 00:18:35.510
So what?

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:37.280
Oh, nothing.

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:42.160
But if the daughter of someone paid to uphold 
the law got involved in an illegal part-time job,

00:18:42.160 --> 00:18:44.210
what do you suppose the father would think?

00:18:44.210 --> 00:18:45.890
Too bad...

00:18:46.290 --> 00:18:48.060
My stupid father

00:18:48.060 --> 00:18:51.350
isn't the type who'd care about that stuff.

00:18:51.350 --> 00:18:52.950
What does that mean?

00:18:52.950 --> 00:18:55.050
Trying to get a pipeline to the police

00:18:55.050 --> 00:18:58.570
as a backup plan won't work.

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:00.950
I didn't mean that...

00:19:03.400 --> 00:19:04.700
Jeez!

00:19:04.700 --> 00:19:08.150
You're too goddamn obvious, fatso!

00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:16.800
What's that?

00:19:32.540 --> 00:19:34.820
What is this? It stinks!

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:51.210
It looks different, but it's the same thing...

00:19:53.520 --> 00:19:55.070
I know it!

00:20:18.210 --> 00:20:19.530
You okay?

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:23.570
So that was you? No one asked for your help.

00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:26.970
Without my help, you would have lost.

00:20:26.970 --> 00:20:29.010
No way.

00:20:29.570 --> 00:20:30.330
Where is he?

00:20:30.930 --> 00:20:33.830
Lying on the ground, somewhere over there.

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:35.190
Huh?

00:20:36.110 --> 00:20:37.460
Looks like he ran.

00:20:39.730 --> 00:20:41.150
Jeez...

00:20:41.150 --> 00:20:43.000
You really are a kid.

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:45.220
You have to finish what you start.

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:03.240
I found something great.

00:22:34.950 --> 00:22:58.270
<b>Kamisama 
Dolls 
Corner</b>

00:22:36.250 --> 00:22:38.730
It's the Kamisama Dolls Corner extended edition!

00:22:36.370 --> 00:22:58.270
<b>Extended</b>

00:22:38.730 --> 00:22:40.540
Hi, all of you in front of the TV.

00:22:40.540 --> 00:22:41.260
Utao here.

00:22:41.260 --> 00:22:42.710
Kukuri, say hello, too.

00:22:43.290 --> 00:22:45.120
Kukuri's spinning more than usual!

00:22:45.120 --> 00:22:46.170
Kukuri's out of energy.

00:22:46.170 --> 00:22:47.620
What's wrong, Kukuri?

00:22:47.620 --> 00:22:49.950
Look at all these questions, you say?

00:22:49.950 --> 00:22:51.930
I can't read all these!

00:22:51.930 --> 00:22:53.040
Let's see...

00:22:53.040 --> 00:22:55.630
"Utao-chan, please tell me (and only me) a secret

00:22:55.630 --> 00:22:56.660
about <i>Kamisama Dolls</i>."

00:22:56.660 --> 00:22:58.270
Okay, leave it to me!

00:22:58.270 --> 00:23:00.270
<b>I'll tell you (and only you) 

00:22:58.270 --> 00:23:00.270
<b>Art : Utao</b>

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:02.670
Here's the inside of Kukuri, as I imagine it.

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:14.790
<b>Kamisama 
Dolls 
Corner</b>

00:23:00.270 --> 00:23:14.790
<b>Extended</b>

00:23:02.640 --> 00:23:07.460
Blade of Justice!! 
(Cuts anything)

00:23:02.640 --> 00:23:07.460
